      "content": "idk the blood clot thing sounds super extreme... i've read online that it's mostly just about how it affects the efficacy of the pill. like, won't it just make the pill less effective instead of causing actual medical emergencies? i'm just looking for something natural to help me feel better, i don't want to go through a whole doctor visit just for some herbal tea or supplements.",
